          },
          "description": "“Right Place, Write Rhymes” is a step by step journey\nfrom the page to the stage! Breaking down the art of writing\nand performing rhymes into a blueprint for beginners, this\ninstructional card guides kids into their own creativity.\n\nThroughout the 7 chapters of this card, GRAMMY winning,\ninternationally touring hip-hop artist Secret Agent 23\nSkidoo distills his 3 decades of experience writing and\nperforming songs into lessons that are easy to understand\nand practice.",
